<title>MEXICO: Grupo Mexico bids on rail line.</title>
<headline>Grupo Mexico bids on rail line.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican mining firm Grupo Mexico S.A. presented the sole bid for the Chihuahua-Pacific railroad line on Wednesday by offering to pay 207.79 million pesos for the concession, government officials said.</p>
<p>Government officials said they would have to evaluate Grupo Mexico's bid to determine whether it met the criteria for the privatization.</p>
</text>
